+# Wire serialisation format
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use CBOR (Concise Binary Object Representation) as the serialisation format for internal messages. It was chosen because its native type tags preserve type and schema information across protocol versions, which allows safer forward and backward compatibility as the protocol evolves.
